  "content": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 1
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Single transcription unit assembly \u2014 Golden Gate conditions"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "blockquote",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Directive \u2014 Lock the assembly chemistry on the easy case, so a later failure is a design failure and not a protocol failure."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Reaction"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "BsaI-HFv2 with T4 ligase, 37 C and 16 C cycling, 30 cycles, followed by a 60 C final digest to linearise unreacted destination vector."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly: "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-525cf33d",
              "label": "J23106",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-525cf33d",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/J23106_AB"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " plus "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-7981ffa1",
              "label": "B0034m",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-7981ffa1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/B0034m_BC"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " plus "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-694681f1",
              "label": "E1010m (mRFP)",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-694681f1",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/E1010m_CD"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " plus "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-5427ea3f",
              "label": "B0015",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-5427ea3f",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/B0015_DE"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " into "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-84ad4efb",
              "label": "DVA_AE",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-84ad4efb",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/DVA_AE"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Why the final digest matters"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Without it, uncut "
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "attrs": {
              "id": "sample-84ad4efb",
              "label": "DVA_AE",
              "entityType": "sequence",
              "entityId": "sample-84ad4efb",
              "path": "sequences/kits/moclo-cidar/DVA_AE"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " carries its own selectable marker and transforms efficiently, producing a background of white colonies that look like failed assemblies. The digest is the difference between a 4 percent and a 92 percent correct rate."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Result"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "92 percent correct by colony PCR, 12 of 13 colonies. The single incorrect colony was an empty vector, not a misassembly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Conditions frozen"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "These conditions are now fixed for the programme. Entry 08 verifies the product; entry 09 uses them for the first real gate."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
